WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:06.980
<i>"Handa-kun and the Continuation of Episode 1"</i>

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:12.200
Handa Sei...

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.320
Second-year high-school student...

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.530
His father, Handa Seimei,
is an authority on calligraphy...

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.990
He himself is a young genius,
well-known in the world of calligraphy.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.750
The path ahead naturally
opens wherever he walks.

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:24.580
Men see him with respect.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.500
Women see him with admiration.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.380
So you came, Handa... kun!

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:34.260
I don't know what's going on,
but make it quick.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:38.470
Huh?! How can you not know
what's going on in this situation?

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.560
I'm not good at reading situations.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.100
Handa-kun is so cool.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.940
He must be used to being confessed to.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:45.350
He wants them to bring it up.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:48.400
In any case, it looks like these two
are the only enemies...

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.820
With girls, it's highly likely this
is going to become a quarrel.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.320
The key here is how I respond
to their initial comments.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:59.910
I'm getting all nervous...

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:00.660
That caught me off guard!

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.580
Her sigh sounded so cute!

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.540
What was that? Some sort of air leak?

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:03.790
Her sigh sounded so cute!

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:09.540
I wrote this letter, since I'm
too nervous to say it.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:11.840
Please take this—

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.050
Sorry, my hand slipped.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:18.260
Well, that scared me a bit...

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:22.470
Juri-chan, you would have broken my
bone with those muscles of yours.

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:24.270
Again, please take this—

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.230
Slipped again!

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:26.810
Huh?

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:28.190
Hey, Juri-chan!

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:29.440
Handa-kun, please take—

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:30.520
Slipped!

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:31.400
W-Wait a sec...

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.980
Whoops! I slipped!

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.110
Handa-kun!

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:35.820
Lemme go!

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.320
Stop it, Juri-chan...

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.410
I'm sure slipping a lot today!

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:40.490
This isn't slipping!

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:42.120
This is way more than a slip!

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.160
Huh? What?

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:44.330
They're fighting?

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.750
Handa... kun! Run!

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:47.920
Huh? I can leave?
Whoa, look at that choke hold!

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:48.500
Whoa, look at that choke hold!

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.840
She may be cute, but she can't
tell when she's hurting others!

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:53.760
What are you saying... Juri..

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.550
Dang it... I don't understand
what she's saying.

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:59.590
And I'm not fit for you, either.

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:02.260
Lemme go... Juri-chan...

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:03.600
That makes less sense...

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:06.730
There you are, Kawa-chan!

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:11.020
It looks like some girls are fighting
over Handa behind the gym.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:12.020
C'mon, let's go!

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:13.400
I'm fine.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:15.150
Not interested.

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:17.610
You're so mature, Kawa-chan.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:19.530
We'll let you know how it turns out tomorrow.

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:24.450
What's he got himself into now?

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.410
Just see him off quietly!

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:28.370
He's more of a man than we can handle!

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:30.040
Lemme go, Juri-chan!

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:32.630
You're the one who cheered me on, Juri-chan!

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:33.920
Wake up already!

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.970
You need to listen to what your heart's saying.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.970
I realized something after
reading Handa-kun's letter.

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:44.140
So she did read it...

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:47.350
A person should be judged by their heart,
not by their appearance!

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:50.190
There are people who love the ugly, too!

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.520
I don't remember writing anything like that...

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:56.730
You felt sorry for me being
in Maiko's shadow, right?

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:58.820
I can tell.

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:00.530
Well, I can't.

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:04.990
My heart lost its beauty the
moment I became jealous of her.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.290
Don't say a word, and just leave.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.960
Just forget about us!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:14.920
There's no way I can forget a character
like her, especially when she's in my class.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.710
Thank goodness, though.

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.170
Looks like I'm free now.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:19.760
Well, I'll be leaving then.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.590
Handa's leaving as if nothing happened!

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:24.470
Handa-kun!

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.430
Stop it already!

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:26.850
Handa-kun!

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:28.060
Give it up!

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:29.770
Nooo!

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:30.640
You girls...

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:37.900
Friends are hard to come by,
so you better take care of each other.

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.160
Handa... kun.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.370
What a man!

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:48.330
Handa-kun!

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:49.040
Maiko!

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:52.960
Here! Read it!

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:53.120
To Handa-kun
Here! Read it!

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:53.670
To Handa-kun

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.590
I did my very best writing it!
To Handa-kun

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:57.630
I'm not letting you go until you read it!
To Handa-kun

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:57.800
I'm not letting you go until you read it!

00:03:59.050 --> 00:03:59.840
Sloppy writing...

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:13.020
Henceforward, those who made confessions
to Handa Sei came to be known as "heroes."

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.770
Stop crying already.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:21.570
But Handa-kun doesn't like me!

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:23.740
He only said your writing wasn't good.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:26.120
Words are everything to Handa-kun!

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:31.500
How about we go and learn
calligraphy together?

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:33.080
Huh?

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.790
We can write nice-looking
love letters to Handa-kun later.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.840
Well, you do write cutely
despite your looks, Juri-chan.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.760
You better fix that personality of yours!

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.890
Seriously, I'm this close to smacking you!

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.760
I don't wanna lose to you, Juri-chan.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:52.100
I'm not going to lose to you, either.

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:55.690
Best friends?

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.270
Yeah, Maiko. Best friends...

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:07.160
...and love rivals.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:25.470
Just tell me! Too many choices to make...

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:28.050
What is the answer? More than I can handle...

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:30.390
I don't know anymore! Got too much liberty...

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.930
Just tell me!! Right now!!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:35.810
Get my words, take my rights!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:38.190
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:38.310
Get my words, take my rights!
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:40.650
Get my words, take my rights!

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:43.110
Everyone's lying to themselves!

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:45.610
After all this grieving... wailing...

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:47.900
has something managed to change?

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:50.780
We run away before the fight even starts,

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.790
as a sorrowful yesterday enters refrain.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:59.670
Get up now! These twised emotions have nowhere to go-

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:02.340
It's a problem everyone faces

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:04.800
unable to even sleep at night!

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.010
C'mon and Break down!

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:09.640
Abandon any half-assed resolutions!

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:14.430
Whether this future can be broken through, or not- you'll never know unless you try!

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:19.980
Searching for an answer, even questioning the times you live in,

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:24.360
No one is going to give you an answer!

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:30.160
So let loose that feeling engraved in your heart-

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:33.990
Choose your liberty... and take it in hand!

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:42.750
My name is Aizawa Junichi.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:45.460
A sharp-minded man with leadership skills.

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:47.510
Nicknamed "Chairperson"!

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:51.010
Following my namesake, I've been
keeping control over classes for ten years.

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:55.220
I didn't think any different of my life
as a class chairperson, but...

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.520
We'll choose by vote.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.770
...all of a sudden, the end was about to come...

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:04.320
To be fair, the voting will be done anonymously.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:07.860
...at the hands of the school's
Mr. Popular, Handa Sei!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:09.400
<i>"Handa-kun and the Chairperson"</i>

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:09.900
A vote for Aizawa-kun

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.740
What's with my anxiety?
A vote for Aizawa-kun

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.950
<i>Ballot Box
There's no way an elite like me would lose.
"Handa-kun and the Chairperson"</i>

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:14.200
There's no way an elite like me would lose.
<i>Ballot Box</i>

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:19.660
What are you thinking,
trying to go against me...

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:21.120
...Handa?!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:27.380
Looks like my name was
brought up while I was dozing.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.800
Being a class chairperson is a pain
so let's get Handa to handle it.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:33.840
I bet he has time, since he only ever does
calligraphy and isn't in any school clubs.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:35.470
I bet that's the plan!

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:40.020
I've done everything I could to make sure
my name would never be brought up.

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.690
Now that it's up there,
refusing is going to mean I lost.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.320
That aside, this Aizawa guy...

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:49.940
He must have gone through a lot, too.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.490
He's looking at me with pity?!

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:55.990
Does he seriously think he's going to win?!

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:57.790
Let's get counting.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.040
Aizawa-kun.

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:00.750
Handa-kun.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.160
Aizawa-kun.

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:03.670
Handa-kun.

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:04.830
Aizawa-kun.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:06.460
Aizawa-kun.

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:07.920
A... A... A...

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.960
What excitement!

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.300
A thrill I haven't experienced before!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:14.930
Every single vote strikes my heart sharply...

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:17.560
...with an indescribable sense
of appreciation and weight!

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:23.190
Moreover, a sense of oneness and a sharing
of tension with Mr. Popular over here!

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.230
So this is what it means to be chosen!

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:30.190
The last one is "Handa-kun."

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.940
Huh? It's a tie.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:32.740
What?!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:37.370
There's no way we can have a tie when we have
twenty-two students minus one truant student.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:40.540
I placed a vote in his stead.

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:42.160
Uh, okay.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.290
Who did he vote for?

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.210
What to do...?

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:48.290
It's my chance to remove myself!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.670
This is no time for me
to be worried over losing!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:51.420
Um...

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.840
What are you saying?!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:56.390
Handa-kun and I are each standing here
with the intent of becoming the chairperson!

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:59.510
Are you taking a serious challenge
between two men lightly?!

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:00.430
No, I...

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:01.350
I see...

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:03.430
Well then, let's decide with rock-paper-scissors.

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.310
I just said "serious challenge"!

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:07.150
They aren't listening...

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:09.270
I think rock-paper-scissors is fine.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:10.020
Yeah, right?

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:10.980
You girls, too?!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:13.860
Well, luck is an ability, so to speak.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.320
I think that's fine, too.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.700
Say something! Stop this!

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:20.280
Well, I guess it can't be helped
if the citizens say so.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.700
Listen up, citizens!

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.870
This is going to be a fair, one-match challenge!

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:28.380
Behold and embrace my battle to come!

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.760
Whoever wins will be the chairperson!

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:33.090
Hoooo
Whoever wins will be the chairperson!

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:33.420
Hoooo

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:37.130
Wait, does he want to be the chairperson?

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:41.060
If there's someone who wants to
take on such a bothersome title...

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.270
...then our interests are mutual!

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:47.600
I'm only going to put out "rock."

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:48.230
Rock.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:48.310
Whooooa
Rock.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:48.980
What?!
Whooooa

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:49.360
Whooooa

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.860
A heads-up?!

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:52.480
What's he thinking?

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.070
Is he trying to deceive me?

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.570
Or is he deceiving me into
thinking I've been deceived?

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.450
What's with that grin?!

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.110
Deception?!

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:00.570
Damn it!

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:02.240
Rock-paper... scissors!

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:05.370
You schemer!

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:06.790
He didn't believe me when I said "rock"!
You schemer!

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.250
He didn't believe me when I said "rock"!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.830
Even if he doesn't like me,
he could have at least trusted me...

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:12.960
Okay, so Handa-kun is the chairperson.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.760
Wait...! Wait, teacher!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.090
Three matches!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.720
This was a three-match challenge!

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:22.220
I thought you said this was
a fair, one-match challenge.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:24.560
Of course not!

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:28.520
This is to elect the chairperson!
Not some chalkboard wiper!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.150
If Handa-kun is okay with it, then...

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:31.900
Please! Until I lose!

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.940
I want to win!

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:34.940
I want to lose!

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:38.610
The two of you seem to have
mutual interests here, you know?

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.160
Okay, once more then.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:40.860
Huh?

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:42.870
Yesss!

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.490
He trusted me this time.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:46.370
Rock again?!

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:49.120
A full-blast schemer!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:52.080
Maybe I should put out "rock"
so that I can make it a tie.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:52.840
No...

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:56.010
It's said that people tend to put out "paper,"
so "scissors" would win,

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:59.260
but Handa-kun said he's going to put
out "rock," so I need to put out "paper,"

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:02.390
but he'll deceive me with "scissors,"
so I need to put out "rock,"

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:04.810
but if he puts out "rock," then it'll be
a tie and the suffering will continue,

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.310
so for me to sever this suffering...

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:10.520
Sever... Sever... Sever... Sever... Sever?!

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:12.940
Rock-paper...

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:17.650
The suffering...

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:17.860
The suffering couldn't be
severed with "scissors"!

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:20.530
Aizawa-kun is a really brilliant idiot...

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.780
It's settled. Handa-kun is the chairperson.

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.330
Wha—?! Wait a minute!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:26.870
No such thing as a five-match challenge, okay?

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.250
I see now...

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:35.040
Four-eyes here was acting like he wanted to
be the chairperson so he could push it onto me.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:39.260
He purposely lost so that I wouldn't
be able to excuse myself from it!

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:42.970
I was framed by four-eyes here from the start?

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:47.850
It's... It's all because I lacked
the heart to believe in others!

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:50.350
He really did keep putting out "rock."

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.850
Handa-kun's a man of his word.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:58.570
I'm now forced to be the chairperson, and am
going to be doing everyone's bidding...

00:11:58.570 --> 00:11:59.940
I can't bear it...

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:03.950
I didn't want to use this, since it makes me
look like I'm caving in to pressure, but...!

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:07.370
Hm? What's up, Chairperson?

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:08.830
I'll step down.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:09.580
What?!

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:12.250
Come to think of it, I'm busy with my work.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.290
Panic is causing him to speak femininely

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.080
Huh?! Noey?! That means...?!

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:18.340
Now then...

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.380
Stop!

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:23.430
I don't want it if you're
relinquishing it out of pity!

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:24.720
The hell is he saying...?!

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:26.470
It isn't pity.

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:29.220
I always thought you should be the one to do it.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:32.180
Then why didn't you decline in the first place?!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:34.810
I felt sorry for you...

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:36.650
I thought you were like me...

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:37.230
Huh?!

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.270
In any case, I'm not doing it.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:41.740
You all figure it out yourselves.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:43.900
Hey, Handa-kun!

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.780
Handa-kun left...

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:47.620
Pretty irresponsible...

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:48.580
That's not it...

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:53.250
From the beginning, I was only concerned
about the title of chairperson.

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.960
I wasn't thinking of everyone.

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:57.750
Through this battle, I learned the importance
of being individuals, and believing in others.

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:01.880
Looking back at the fierce battle

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:04.010
No... He taught me.

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:07.890
All because Handa-kun felt
"sorry" for my conceited self.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.600
He really is something.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.060
I see...

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:16.060
Though seeing him step down
in pity was a bit miserable.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:17.310
That wasn't pity.

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:17.810
Huh?

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:18.480
Aizawa

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:22.030
Handa-kun cast his vote
for you in the first place.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.820
Well, there goes anonymity...

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:24.320
Tearing up

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.660
It can't be... Handa-kun voted for me?
Tearing up

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:27.240
Tearing up

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.160
Chairperson's crying.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:31.700
Handa-kun's the man!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.410
If Handa-kun agrees,
then Aizawa's the chairperson.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:38.540
No, I can finally see clearly
through all that happened today.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:42.000
The person most befitting should
take on the role of chairperson.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:46.180
I haven't felt this good in forever!

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:51.430
Vice Chairperson:
Aizawa Junichi
Chairperson:
Handa Sei

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:52.850
I've been had!

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:55.020
After you left, we spoke a bit...

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.900
...and came to the conclusion that there's
no one better than you, Handa-kun.

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:00.810
I can't believe the evil that
transpired while I was gone!

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:03.110
Handa-kun, you have
your work as a calligrapher,

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:05.070
so I'll take care of all the common duties!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:09.820
Let's do our best so that we don't lose in
study and activity against the other classes!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.910
Um, one question.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:13.660
What?

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.540
What does a chairperson do?

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:18.960
Chairperson:
Handa Sei

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:19.540
Huh?

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:19.960
Chairperson:
Handa Sei

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.170
Name's Nikaido Reo.

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.250
17 years old.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.420
Weird for me to say it myself, but...

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:31.930
...I'm handsome!

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:34.810
I'm a student and a model.

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.940
I'm always the target of attention
from girls wherever I go.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.270
I'm the school's most loved guy!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:48.070
It's smooth sailing for my high-school life!

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.530
Or at least that was the plan...

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:51.030
<i>"Handa-kun and the Model"</i>

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:53.280
Come now, in the middle of daylight?
<i>"Handa-kun and the Model"</i>

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:54.160
<i>"Handa-kun and the Model"</i>

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:55.950
Handa-kun, look over here!
<i>"Handa-kun and the Model"</i>

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:56.830
Handa-kun, look over here!

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.790
...until I ended up in the
same class as Handa Sei.

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:06.210
Caroline's No.1 Pick

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:08.880
Reo, you were on this month's issue
of Men's Revolution, right?

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:09.420
Spring's the season
for prints

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:11.970
Was I? I forgot.

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:12.970
I'm lying...

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.600
Caroline Yamauchi did the styling, right?

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:17.560
Is that the person who scouted Reo?

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:18.480
Yup, yup!

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:23.020
Well, I do have a following and
a brilliant job as a model to boot.

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:25.940
This would probably look
good on Handa-kun, too!

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:28.280
Wh-Wh-Why did Handa's name get brought up?!

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:29.650
You girls are supposed to be my fans!

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.410
What you're doing is called flirting!

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:33.280
C'mon, he's gonna hear us!

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.830
Wouldn't mind seeing him
in his normal clothes, right?

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:35.780
Right! Sure wouldn't!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:38.200
I, better settle this, once and for all.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:39.500
Say...

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.210
Honestly speaking, between me
and Handa, who's better?

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:44.130
Huh?

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.750
What's with that irritating laugh?

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:49.630
You're so confident, and yet you
think of that sort of thing?

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.130
What, is he your rival?

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.890
No... No, no, no!

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:54.760
He's not my rival or anything!

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:56.970
I was just curious, that's all.

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.520
Not like I'm concerned
over how others see things.

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.480
Who's better?

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:02.940
Let's see...

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:04.940
I think you're more handsome, Reo.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.110
You are a model, after all.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:06.980
Well, an amateur one.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:11.490
But there's more to Handa-kun than just looks.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.870
There's just something about him.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.580
Being bad-mouthed again, aren't I?

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:21.290
B-But I'm a lot more
approachable and kind, right?

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:23.620
Guys are more than just looks.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:25.290
Silent and mysterious.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:28.840
Sure, Handa-kun's words are stern,
but coming from him, that's A-OK.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:32.090
Unlike models, he handles
historical and cultural work,

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.180
so not being approachable isn't an issue.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.930
He's like an unreachable flower!

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:40.390
But from that standpoint, I'm an
unreachable flower of a model, right?

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.640
How many centimeters
does it take to reach you?

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:43.520
Like, knee length?

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:43.980
Right?
Like, knee length?

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:47.110
The girls who I thought were fans
are scathing as demons.
Right?

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:47.360
Right?

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:50.280
A charm he has that I don't...

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:54.200
In that case...

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.740
...I'll find out for myself!

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:00.540
He isn't in any school clubs.

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:03.540
If there's a secret to his charm,
it has to be outside of school.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.380
Is he going to secretly smooth talk
girls like some routine work?

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.670
Or could he be paying girls to like him?

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:17.050
I'm going to find out your dirty little secret!

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:17.970
Huh?

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:22.770
Handa's... being followed by a weirdo?

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:25.140
Hm?! A group of girls headed this way!

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:26.270
Let's see this!

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:27.520
He disappeared?!

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:29.310
Where'd he go?!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:31.020
Hey, it's Reo-kun.

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:33.490
H-Hey there, Ech-chan, Kayo-chan, Midori-chan!

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:36.570
What's up with the sunglasses? Work?

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:37.570
Well, uh, yeah...

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:41.580
I felt like Handa-kun was
around here. Did you see him?

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.790
Huh?! Handa?!

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:46.920
Uh, no! I didn't see him at all!

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:49.330
It's Handa! Handa's getting away!

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:51.460
Good luck with your work!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:52.750
Bye-bye!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.510
Damn it! I lost Handa!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.520
Handa! Handa! Handa!

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:06.480
Handaaa!

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:17.700
What's he staring at?

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:18.950
A cat?

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:21.700
Why a cat?

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:27.870
Does he like cats?

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:28.870
Or does he hate cats?

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:32.880
If you like them, pet it.
If not, shoo it away!

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:36.800
The cat looks so uncomfortable!

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:40.840
Moving, finally!

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:42.720
Thirty minutes of staring at the cat...

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:44.470
Is there some secret to this cat?

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:50.850
I see!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:52.610
That stare is Handa's secret!

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:55.230
He's using that stare to enthrall girls!

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:57.740
I'm finally starting to get
your charming techniques!

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:01.280
Cat allergy

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:04.330
I better hurry and get whatever
it is I was asked to go and buy.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:05.580
Mom
Buy me a
shu-shu scrunchie

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:06.950
A "shu-shu"?

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:07.910
What's a "shu-shu"?

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:09.540
This place...

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:14.090
This is the fashion street where
I was scouted by Caroline Yamauchi!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:16.170
The time...!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:20.050
As expected, model agency
scouts are all over the place!

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:25.260
If Handa gets scouted,
he'll be a model in no time!

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:26.970
A road directly to being loved!

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:30.310
He'll make me suffer,
even in the world of models!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.810
I... I have to stop that from happening!

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:35.770
Say, Taniguchi?

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:37.150
He's pretty good, right?

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.650
Yes, he is! Let me go and—

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:41.740
Suuup! How are you doing, Caroline-san?!

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.370
Oh, my, if it isn't Reo.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:45.450
What's with those dirty clothes of yours?

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.870
Oh, I just found a really good kid, and—

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:48.370
H-Huh...?!
Oh, I just found a really good kid, and—

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:48.870
H-Huh...?!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:50.330
There's no one there!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:51.580
Shu-shu?

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:53.290
There's a shu-shu shop?

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:54.500
What's a shu-shu?

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:56.710
He's a pretty sharp... looking kid!

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:57.920
Huh? No one's there!

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:58.760
I'm getting good vibes!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:19:59.670
No one's...!

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:00.590
Shu-shu as in the "choo-choo" of a locomotive?

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:02.300
Choo-Choo

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:02.510
Huh?! Huh?! Huh?!

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:03.930
There! The person in the school clothes.

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:04.590
Huh?! Huh?! Huh?!

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:05.510
I need to speak with him!

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:10.560
I have no time to fool around with you!

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:11.980
M-My face...?

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:13.770
I'm a model too—

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:15.770
Say, you over there.

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:17.020
How'd you like to wear this?

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:19.480
Nooo!

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:20.440
Stop it, Reo!

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:20.740
I won't let you have him wear that!
Stop it, Reo!

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.860
I won't let you have him wear that!

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:23.910
Who do you think made you into a model?!

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:27.030
I don't know what they want with me,
but in any case, they're nuts!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.080
Now... wear it!

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:31.660
Too shady to be legit!!
Now... wear it!

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:33.040
Too shady to be legit!
Too shady to be legit!!

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:38.300
All you need to do is to rise to stardom
wearing the clothes I choose!

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.260
Damn it! It's too late!

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:42.760
Being a model was my only source of pride!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:46.340
Am I going to lose everything?!

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:49.260
What are you saying?

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.850
He's the one who needs this the most now.

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:56.690
I don't know what value these clothes have...

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:58.900
...but I have no need for it.

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.740
Please reach out to those who need it.

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:03.400
If you'll excuse me...

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:04.990
Wait...!

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:07.700
What's this?

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:12.580
This... warm feeling.

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:17.670
So this is why Handa Sei is loved...

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:21.590
He looks warmly upon people from afar...

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.260
...and doesn't flatter people
or taint himself in common ways.

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.510
My respect to you,
from the bottom of my heart...

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:30.510
His clothes sure were dirty.

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:32.930
Must be going through a lot at his age.

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.440
Reo, is it true you quit being a model?!

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:38.060
You gals sure are quick.

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:40.770
Caroline blogged about how you made her mad.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.730
I didn't "quit." More like "fired."

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:45.070
I just didn't have it in me.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:48.070
I'm kinda surprised you'd say that, Reo.

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:49.740
You sound so mature!

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:54.960
It isn't worth dwelling on being
competitive or having pride.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:57.580
I saw what it is to be a real man.

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:00.960
A man of purity, indifferent to conflict...

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:04.010
Meanwhile, that same man of purity...

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:08.180
...was cursing a lady who
cut in line at the bus stop.
Trip! Trip! Trip! Trip!...

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:09.970
Trip! Trip! Trip! Trip!...

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:21.610
Don't look for me- Don't look for me-

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:24.900
I'd rather not register in anyone's gaze,

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:31.080
'Cause I'm still not settled into this world.

00:22:33.140 --> 00:22:36.960
Though I'm so transient, I've always said,

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:42.210
"Someday, this unfair way of living will come back to bite me!"

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:46.470
'Cause what I really want,

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:50.180
Is to be laughing along with everyone else!

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:54.140
My HIDE-AND-SEEK continues...

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:58.400
My voice still can't make a sound,

00:23:00.640 --> 00:23:05.990
But I wonder if I can communicate this... all my thoughts and feelings!

00:23:05.990 --> 00:23:11.160
I can always hear it in the distance...

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:18.830
And someday, I'd like to once again answer that call.

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:22.040
The day when I'll be told, "It's alright, you've done all you can,"

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:26.300
May be closer to arribing than I thought.

00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:42.100
Maiko, what's with that box?

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:43.860
I baked some cookies yesterday!

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:46.230
I wonder if Handa-kun is going to like them.

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:48.230
There he is!

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:49.240
He's staring at it!

00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:51.450
Handa-kun's looking at my cookies!

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:52.860
He put it in the class lost and found
like it was nothing!

00:23:52.860 --> 00:23:56.030
Lost and Found
He put it in the class lost and found
like it was nothing!

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:02.580
Next time... "Handa-kun and the Truant.

00:24:03.420 --> 00:24:04.920
Handa-kun and Cooking Class.

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:07.170
Handa-kun and His Friend."

00:24:08.300 --> 00:24:09.010
See you again!
